10. Code Structure
The code is divided into clear functional blocks:
Initialization: LCD, servo, and sensor setup
getDistance(): Measures and returns distance
Sweep loops: Move servo forward and backward
LCD updates: Display angle and distance
This modular structure makes the program easy to read and modify.


